  "releaseNotes": "v0.17.1: Add BeginToolBlockAsync / ResolveToolBlockAsync — two-stage tool block render with a pulsing placeholder that rewrites in place when the result arrives. ChatPanel uses this for sub-agent (delegate_task) calls so parallel fan-outs no longer leave the UI silent for tens of seconds. Cancellation sweep replaces any still-pending block with an [interrupted] marker. Fix orphaned \"Continue writing...\" user message surviving into .astx saves — UnregisterFromTree prunes both _messages and the children tree, recomputes sibling indices, and rewires parent ActiveChildId. Continue flow now runs ResumeMessageAsync / CTS setup inside try so finally-driven cleanup covers every path. Additive API surface; existing AppendToolBlockAsync callers unchanged.",
